! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! Proposed Definition of ''xo''
;__xo__: question word to which the answer is a number
!! Examples of ''xo'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''ci'i''
;__ci'i__: infinity; when followed by a number, denotes a transfinite cardinal, such as ℵ{SUB()}0{SUB}, or a transfinite ordinal, such as ω{SUB()}0{SUB}.
!! Examples of ''ci'i'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''ka'o''
;__ka'o__: imaginary unit
!! Examples of ''ka'o'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''pai''
;__pai__: pi
!! Examples of ''pai'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''te'o''
;__te'o__: e
!! Examples of ''te'o'' Usage
''li te'o te'a ka'o bi'e pi'i pai su'i pa du li no''
!! Proposed Definition of ''tu'o''
;__tu'o__: null operand; inspecific number or placeholder digit
!! Examples of ''tu'o'' Usage